**Audio Input** (32 tokens/second):
- 1 minute = 1,920 tokens
- 10 minutes = 19,200 tokens
- 1 hour = 115,200 tokens
- 9.5 hours = 1,094,400 tokens

**Example costs** (Gemini 2.5 Flash at $1/1M):
