## Version-Specific Documentation

**Latest (default):**
- Use base llms.txt URL
- No version specifier needed

**Specific version:**
```
WebSearch: "[library] v[version] llms.txt"
Check paths:
- /v2/llms.txt
- /docs/v2/llms.txt
- /{version}/llms.txt

For repos:
