## Adjustments

### Brightness & Contrast

```bash
# Increase brightness
magick input.jpg -brightness-contrast 10x0 output.jpg

# Increase contrast
magick input.jpg -brightness-contrast 0x20 output.jpg

# Both
magick input.jpg -brightness-contrast 10x20 output.jpg

