```

### Auto Corrections

```bash
# Auto level (normalize contrast)
magick input.jpg -auto-level output.jpg

# Auto gamma correction
magick input.jpg -auto-gamma output.jpg

# Normalize (stretch histogram)
magick input.jpg -normalize output.jpg

